3m = {prio:1} 16+ hcp, 4+m
  #STOP
#STOP

1S-(D)-2H-(P)-
3H = {prio:1} 16+ hcp, 3+!h
  #STOP
#STOP

1M-(D)-2M-(P)-
4M = {prio:1} 17+ hcp
  #STOP
#STOP

Responder after that rebid: over 2NT (12--14) he bids 3NT with 13+; over the
cheapest rebid of the opening suit 3NT with 13+ and a stopper; over the raise
of his major, game with 13+. Otherwise he passes.

